summary:
The article introduces parser combinators as functions that consume input and
 return a parsed value plus remaining text. It demonstrates sequencing, mapping, repeated parsing,
and folding while parsing greetings and ping output.

The article walks through Aspire Deploy, a .NET MAUI Blazor Hybrid application
for deploying Aspire 13.x solutions to Azure Container Apps. It covers setup, deploy profiles,
resource selection, dry runs, logging, AI assistance, and cleanup.
